    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yosia waawuti'iimár Yuda ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a dakaát, ina waawuti'ín baraá Yerusalemúr wa alé, kureeri mibeeri tám nee wak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE adór ganaa' gana tleéhh, inós loohír waawutmo Daudi gana óh, sleeme aa baloó bihhaá xuiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú dakaát baraá waawuti'iimarose, qoomaadae inós a masoomoó niiná, inós Munguú baabuúwós Daudi guna leeleéhh ar muunaáwós sleémeero. Kurkú mibaá nee tsare wa/aameedár gawaá gongoama' ar munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmiisi gana iimu/ún hingeemisuwo, nee slaqsi'iidaá Ashera, nee kudá' taa hhasliít, nee kudá' taa kwahhuuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteeridá' ta ilahhooa hanmaamisi dír Ba'ali kina dír geeraawós wa daraáhh, kiteeridá' taa gáwtí tleereés ta mooyángw i da/aa/an inós gina sií'. Munguúdá' ta bay Ashera kuri naasúy, nee slaqsa'aá hatlá' kudá' taa hhasliít nee awa taa kwahhuuti, teeridá' gari kwahhtá áy gawaá /antaá mukdá' aáng slaqsi'iiká' gaa sluufmaamiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fadaá kaahamuusér munguiidá' giri dá/ gawaá kiteeriidá' ta ilahhooárií hanmaamisi dír munguaá hatlá'. Gawaá adoorihe yaamaá Yuda nee awa Yerusalemu gina hhoohhooeés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí gana tleéhh sleeme baraá gixsadaá yaamaá Manasewo nee awa Efraimu, nee awa Simeonuwo, ay yaamaá Naftaliwo, nee baraá sluhhayduú wa/ameedá' i tsewén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteeridá' awa munguúdá' ta bay Ashera gina naasúy, munguiidaá hatlá' gina teeri tleéhh. Sleeme kiteeridaá mooyángw tsuú' kuy da/aa/an baraá yaamaá Israeliro gina hingeés. Aluuwo iri kií/ Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibaá nee dakaát baraá waawuti'iimaro, alaá yaamu ngiwa hhohhoeés, nee doó Munguhe, waawutmo Yosia muu tám guri ya/aáw doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwós, kuwa iisluki. Mukdá' a Shafani garmoó Asalia, nee Ma'aseya ga/aawusmoó gixsa, nee Yoa garmoó Yoahasi kuduú goousmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín niri hardihiyé' dír Hilkia kaahamusmoó úr, peésaadá' tinda huúw baraá doó Mungú ngiri dirós i haniisiyé', tidá' tinda burumbuúr nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi nee kudá' afkú doó ga/áw, tidá' tinda huúw amór tlahhoo Efraimu wa ale, nee oo Manase, nee bihhér hatlá' sleémeero ar yaamaá Israeli, nee yaamaá Yuda sleémeero nee awa Benyamini, nee amór yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peésaadá' kari haniís dír mukdá' doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gwa sagesihiit qoomár kuwa iislukun, nee dír mukdá' aa gadiyuus baraá doó Mungú wa ale, as do' kuwa iislukun nee kuwa /abeemisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kari haniís dír mukdá' peehhoó hhasliít as kawa tlaa/er tlaxwi, nee peehhoó ta dinkwárí slahhan, nee uheemaá oohi kudá' ta do'odár tleehhi, doo'odá' waawituú Yuda aa máy iri fee/amiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu gadiyeérí gana tlehhiít ar inkihhimu. Múk tlahhoó Laáwi oo geeraharuusér mukwí oo taa qaás a kwí: Yahati nee Obadia awa guruú doó Merari, dinkwa nee Sekaria nee Meshulamu kudaá guruú doo Kohati. Múk tlahhoó Laáwi oo hatlá' xooslaá daa'aangw slahhto ki ló'wa xuu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi múk huwaá loohís nguna sagesihhmiitiyé', nee kudá' gadiyedaá dimbadiimbé ngi tlehhiitá' nguna geeraharahariyé', bahh'ale a goouuse, nee kookaariya' a xuumuusér afér gixsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár inooín peésaadá' tinda huúw baraá Doó Mungú kingiwa duxun, kaahamusmoó Mungú Hilkia kitaábuú dabér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tidá' aa haniís ar dákw Mose, gway sláy baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilkia goousmo Shafani guri báy, «Kitaábuú dabe ugwa sláw baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale.» Kitaábuúdá' gway haniís dír Shafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafani kitaábuudá' gway huúw dír waawutmo, nee kángw gadiyeé guri káh sleeme iwa kaahi, «Sagadiyuuserók tidá' sleémeero kaa beér ngi tlehhiitiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín peésaadá' taa sláy baraá Doó Mungú wa ale, kaa haniís dír mukdá' gadiyér sagesihhimiít nee dír kudá' gadiyuús.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goousmo Shafani iri malé oó', «Hilkia kaahamusmoó Mungú kitaábuuko ngwa haniís.» Aluuwo Shafani kitaábuudá' gway soomuús dír waawutmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawutmo /ayma'aá kitaábuuduú dabe ngiwa axaás, tlabaawós gay feehhamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Yosia Hilkia nee Ahikamu garmoó Shafani, nee Abdoni garmoó Mika, nee goousmoó Shafani, nee Asaya sagadiyusmoó waawutmo, giri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tlawsé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ yaahasaare' as aníng, nee as mukwí aa meet baraá Israeliro nee Yudawo, daanduú axweesanoó baraá kitaábuú dabe taa sláy, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa daa/atúy buhhtaawo as atén, asma baabi'iirén axweesantós ngaa ya/ani'iiká ar adoodá' ir qoon kara gooín baraá kitaábuuwí.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilkia nee mukduú hatlá' waawutmo aa ya/aáw tari tláy dír aaruso'o Hulda, harér Shalumu garmoó Tokhati, garmoó Hasra, kudá' tlabaá amohhe'eemaamiís, (inós Yerusalemuro do'ós i baraá hháw tsár). Kangwdá' aa tleehharuumiit kuri dirós i oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín giri beér, «Adoorí an adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli i kaahi, heesíng kuungá' naa amor'eénií ya/aaw ku beera', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, ‹Qaytsiít, aníng amotlakwe ngi huúw baraá Yerusalemu nee dír múk baraadá' hoót, daanduú axweesanaydá' sleémeero oo lo'o, kudá' taa gooín baraá kitaábuudá' taa soomuús dír waawutmoó Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aníng ina geexayé', munguaá hatlá' ngay mooyángw tsuú' i da/iyé', aníng iga buhhtisiyé' daanduú gadiyedá' naa dabaaín ar tleehhii'i. Gawaá adoorihe aníng yaamuuká' i ii daa/atúw buhhtawo, heé i har'óh i kaahh.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala daanduú waawutmoó Yudawo, kudá' kuungá' na ya/aaw amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i ale, ku beera', ‹Adoorí an adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, i kaahi daanduú axweesantadá' taa axasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuúng muunaáwók kuwa hhoó' nee tiri niinawés dír geeraaeé', nee tlabaawók kiri feehhamís, nee tari /aa/amiín, qoomár axweesanay'eé' kuwa axás daanduú yaamuukae, nee daanduú yaamuloouuser'ine, tiri niinawés dír geeraaeé'. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuúg ugwa axaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aawek kuúng bar aga gwá', tun foól ar wayda, tari haraagwá' amór baabi'iiwók, slahh'amuuwí ni huuw baraá yaamuuká' nee dír yaamuuloouuseerós ilaawók ngu ariiaaká.› » Naagáy mukdá' taa ya/aáw kaangwí nguri ki/ís amór waawutmo Yosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yosia bariisér Yuda nee ar Yerusalemu gari i ya/abín, tari burumburiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo dinkwa nee muu sleémeero oo Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu nee kaahamuusér Mungú, nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi nee na/ii nee múk urene tari tsa/án amór Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Waawutmo axweesanoó kitaábuuduú alqado taa sláy baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale, guri soomuús dir'íní aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo iri dirós tidá' i sihhiít, alqado gari oó' ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa eehari nee hara'ayaarós, nee tidá' aa ooi nee kaahirose ngiwa oohi ar muunaáwós sleémeero nee ar qeeruuwós sleémeero, nee axweesanay sleémeero kudá' taa gooín baraá kitaábuuduú alqado nguwa boo/eesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo múk Yerusalemu nee oo Benyamini sleémeero guri /uurutís baraá alqadoodií ale. Inooín tari hoót ar adoodá' alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'ii'ín i kat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yosia slaqsi'iidá' sleémeero ta waki giri hingeés baraá yaamuudá' sleémeero awa aalír Israeli sleémeero, múk Israeli guri /uurutís AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín, nguwa sagadiyuusiya' nee nguwa sluufmisiya'. Deelo sleémeero ar Yosia iwa slafi inooín AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'ii'ín, ngwaa baloó geexay'iiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
